{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18207050","asset_path":"ep8/quest_story/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__ep8__quest_story_18207050.decoded.json","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18207050","roots":["document:0:629:0"],"nodes":{"document:0:629:0":{"id":"document:0:629:0","type":"document","source_node_id":"0","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","entry_kind":"document","dialogue_frame_type":"","dialogue_frame_type_source":"","animation_set":"","text_key":"document:0:629:0","speaker_key":"","speaker_actor_id":"","speaker_actor_model":"","next":"line:1:say:1820705001:0"},"line:1:say:1820705001:0":{"id":"line:1:say:1820705001:0","type":"line","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","entry_kind":"say","dialogue_frame_type":"Slim","dialogue_frame_type_source":"","animation_set":"normal","text_key":"say:1:1820705001:0","speaker_key":"speaker:主角","speaker_actor_id":"0","speaker_actor_model":"","next":"end:2","cast_state":{"source":"decoded_nodecanvas_actions","status":"exact","variant_count":1,"variants":[{"index":1,"actors":[],"position_events":[],"active_actor_ids":[],"line_animation_set":"normal","line_json_path":"nodes[1]._action","line_action_type":"__NC.Tasks.Actions.SayBase"}]}},"end:2":{"id":"end:2","type":"end","source_node_id":"2"}},"text_entries":{"document:0:629:0":{"key":"document:0:629:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"0","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"………………………………\n对于生者而言，在学习魔法的过程中，无论其主攻何种魔法，其魔力都将逐渐与其生命绑定。唯一的例外是研究亡灵魔法的生者，由于死亡力量与生命状态本身互斥，其魔力无法绑定。\n魔法师逝世后，魔力将随生命一同消散。如果不幸变为亡灵，已经与生命状态绑定的魔力或是受到限制、无法发挥，或是直接消散，只有尚未绑定的部分魔力仍可以利用。\n幸运的是，此种魔力状态可逆，只需持续不断研究亡灵魔法，即可改变魔力的绑定，令自己的魔法水平回归与生前一致的水平。只是此后所使用的魔法都基于亡灵魔法的基础之上。\n（后面没有任何有价值的信息）","textdes_id":"629","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"魔法理论概述","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item12.png","do